 equipment available for rent.  We offer a wide selection to meet your specific needs.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:100%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group process-steps is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-c020569f wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">02<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"line-height:1.1\">Select <br>your Equipment<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Browse through our inventory, choose the items you need, and easily book them for the desired rental period.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:100%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group process-steps is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-c020569f wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">03<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"line-height:1.1\">Confirm <\/h3>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"line-height:1.1\">and Reserve<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our team ensures prompt delivery to your designated location. Plus, our knowledgeable customer support is available to assist you.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-f56f613f wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:66%\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"820\" height=\"903\" src=\"https:\/\/demo.webdevia.com\/cabinets-kitchen-bathroom-vanities-store-wordpress-theme\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/03\/portfolio_card_2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2746\" style=\"aspect-ratio:3\/2;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https:\/\/demo.webdevia.com\/cabinets-kitchen-bathroom-vanities-store-